# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_154.imu

The board's QMI8658 inertial sensor at address 0x6b, with 0x6a as the alternate
its SA0 strap may select.

It shares I2C1 with the board's codec and, on the touch model, its touch
controller: SDA on GP6 and SCL on GP7.
Each provider configures that bus before its first transfer, which is
idempotent and means no provider depends on another having been initialised
first.
